	"data": "2026-08-05\n\nEvents\nOptiplex networking incident resolved. Root cause: Tailscale on Star hijacking LAN subnet via table 52 (HA advertising 192.168.1.0/24, black-holed when HA offline). Fix: removed route, fixed SSH config, created persistence service. nft flush on Optiplex was unnecessary and broke Caddy port forwarding — full Docker restart repaired it. cithoreal requested deep homelab stability plan. Issues to address: Optiplex network instability, HA uptime, vision models broken, overall…",
